# ==============================================================================
# PrivacyCart — Environment Variables Configuration Template
# SPPU Third-Year Computer Engineering Project
# ==============================================================================

# SUPABASE LIVE DATABASE CONNECTION (OPTIONAL)
# If left blank or unconfigured, PrivacyCart will automatically activate its
# Academic Local Demonstration Mode (using simulated RLS & browser memory).
#
# To connect your live Supabase cloud project:
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the provided `schema.sql` in the Supabase SQL Editor to initialize tables and RLS.
# 3. Copy your Project URL and Anon Public Key from Project Settings > API.
# 4. Rename this file to `.env` and fill the variables below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# ==============================================================================
# CRITICAL SECURITY PROTOCOL:
# - NEVER put `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` or master database passwords in this file!
# - The frontend only ever interacts with Supabase using the Anon Key protected by Row Level Security (RLS).
# - Service role keys bypass all RLS policies and must never be exposed to browser clients.
# ==============================================================================
